//   its own session,
// - 4624: a System logon, which Windows numbers 0 and OCSF 1,
// - 4625: a failed network logon without subject,
// - 4634: a logoff with an unknown protocol,
// - 4648: an explicit-credential logon that Windows audits as a success,
//   without the outcome of the logon,
// - 4769: a service ticket for a requested service.
// 4624 and 4625 report the logon type number as `authentication_method` and
// the package as `authentication_service`. Other events report the protocol
// as the method.
